This file has attributes that BePDF uses for bookmarks and metadata. Toji uses a universal standard schema for the metadata and Web Annotations for the bookmarks, which BePDF does not know. The document itself stays as it is.\n\nDo you want to keep the proprietary attributes for use in BePDF, or upgrade to the standard ones? Upgrading is recommended unless you still use BePDF with this file. You can change this later in the settings.	PDFWindow		
